msgctxt "#32161"
msgid "These are Kodi's own settings under Settings > Player > Videos. Suggested: a skip delay of 1000 ms and 10 seconds each press, so the picture walks evenly and Kodi jumps once, when you stop pressing. Custom: use the two values below. Leave as they are: the add-on changes nothing, and puts back what it found if it changed them before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32162"
msgid "How long Kodi waits after your last press before it jumps. The preview shows during this wait. Shorter jumps sooner; too short and Kodi jumps between two presses, which makes the video stutter. Kodi's default is 750."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32163"
msgid "With one step, every press adds the same amount (10, 20, 30 seconds and so on). With several steps, every press moves to the next bigger step."
msgstr ""

