msgctxt "#32114"
msgid "Used when the fit is Custom, or Automatic on a skin with no fit. How far the box sits from the bottom (or top) edge, out of 720. Raise it if the box covers the skin's seek bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32116"
msgid "Automatic: on a skin the add-on knows (Aeon Nox: SiLVO) the box sits right on top of the skin's seek bar, over the spot you are skipping to; on other skins the Custom values below are used. Custom: always use the values below."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32117"
msgid "Used when the fit is Custom, or Automatic on a skin with no fit. How close the box goes to the left and right sides, out of 1280."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32118"
msgid "Fine adjustment, out of 720, on top of the fit or the Custom values. 0 leaves the box where the fit puts it."
msgstr ""
